  <!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->
  <section class="faq-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="faq-layout">
        <div class="faq-heading">
          <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list" data-faq-list>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-1">
            What is Facility Intelligence?
            <svg class="chevron" width="12" height="7" viewBox="0 0 12 7" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M1 1l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-answer-1" hidden>
             Buying decisions for technically complex solutions like Material handling or warehouse automation rarely originate in the board room. They show up as problems on the warehousing floor much earlier and leave digital breadcrumbs. Automatisor does a deep research on each facility to uncover these breadcrumbs and convert them into insights about its operations, labor, inventory, infrastructure, financial & regulatory aspects. It gathers 200+ unique insights at a facility level from 20+ pre-vetted and validated data sources. It also periodically refreshes it to ensure the right, recent and relevant ground truth is available to you.          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-2">
            What is an Ideal Facility Profile?
            <svg class="chevron" width="12" height="7" viewBox="0 0 12 7" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M1 1l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-answer-2" hidden>
          An Ideal Facility Profile describes the warehousing facility that has the operational conditions to make it a good fit for your specific products or services. For ex: “Fulfilment sites with each picking operations spanning 200k+ sq.ft and running 2 or more shifts”. It does not describe people unlike the Ideal Customer Profile (ICP). 
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-6">
            Which Go-to-Market motions can Automatisor enable?
            <svg class="chevron" width="12" height="7" viewBox="0 0 12 7" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M1 1l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-answer-6" hidden>
          Automatisor adapts to however your business goes to market, the underlying intelligence stays the same; what changes is who acts on it.<br><br><strong>Direct Sales</strong><br>Your own revenue teams get facility intelligence, fit-matching, and outreach plans built around your accounts directly. Discovering, qualifying, and prospecting warehouses your reps own end-to-end.<br><br><strong>Channel Partners</strong><br>Equip your partners with the same fit-matched, evidence-backed facility intelligence you'd use internally, so they prioritize the right accounts in their territory instead of guessing at your ICP from a spec sheet.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-3">
            What counts as a 'chargeable' warehousing facility in the plan?
            <svg class="chevron" width="12" height="7" viewBox="0 0 12 7" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M1 1l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-answer-3" hidden>
            A facility for which Automatisor can successfully gather Facility Intelligence will be counted as chargeable towards your plan’s limits. If Automatisor fails, you are not charged. Simple.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-4">
            What can I do on the 14-day free trial?
            <svg class="chevron" width="12" height="7" viewBox="0 0 12 7" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M1 1l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-answer-4" hidden>
            You can discover warehouses that match a criteria and are around a location (eg: Distribution centers near McDonaugh, GA). You can request Automatisor to research them. Automatisor helps you decide whether it would be a good fit for your specific offerings and prepare you to target them. You can then create highly personalised 1:1 outreach campaigns and personalise messaging to the account using facility intelligence. Automatisor gives you a couple of real, fully researched warehousing sites for you to play around with. You can add up to 5 warehousing facilities of your own to start building your deal pipeline.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-5">
            Do you offer custom plans for larger teams?
            <svg class="chevron" width="12" height="7" viewBox="0 0 12 7" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M1 1l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-answer-5" hidden>
            Yes, we work with organizations having multiple revenue teams - ABM marketing, business development, strategic account manager, account executives and even 3rd party BD teams. We enable comprehensive ABM and outreach motions to boost your lead generation efforts. <a href="/demo">Talk to us</a> to learn more.          </div>
        </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

